      "status": "completed",
      "mode": "exploit",
      "parent": "1-2",
      "children": [],
      "decisions": [],
      "notes": "已精读。五大支柱：①Cordis 插件树（无特权核，一切皆插件，注册即 effect）②Profile/Bundle 分层组合（dsh-base → web-app/headless，patch 逐层覆盖，dsh --dump-config 可见）③Turn/Step 流（step=一次模型请求+工具，turn 由 inbox 驱动，waterfall 事件链 pre-step→request→llm/stream→tools pipeline）④Session log 是唯一真相（Model-visible means logged，deriveMessages() 从日志投影模型历史）⑤Capability seam 三件套（Service Definition+Provider+Consumer，换 provider 即换整个执行世界）。新行为落点表：cookbook/extension-cookbook.md 是索引入口"
    },
